# Everything the image must build for itself.
#
# Without this the build context is the working tree — a gigabyte of
# `node_modules` and a `.next` from somebody's laptop, uploaded to the daemon
# on every build and then shadowed by the image's own install. Slow, and worse
# than slow: a stale `.next` copied in would be served instead of the one the
# image built.
node_modules
.next
out
coverage

# Local secrets and local state. `.env.local` carries this developer's
# platform credentials; the container is configured by compose.
.env*.local
.env

# Evidence and scratch output. `e2e/evidence` is hundreds of PNGs.
e2e/evidence
playwright-report
test-results

.git
.github
*.log
